            Engineering academy and rapid application incubator. Managing cross-functional developer teams to deliver real-world MVPs using unified KMP architectures.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bay-footer">
          <span class="metal-tag">Rapid MVPs</span>
          <span class="metal-tag">KMP Mentorship</span>
          <span class="metal-tag">Architecture</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Tile 3: KMP-CLI (6 cols) -->
    <div class="tilt-card-wrapper col-span-6">
      <div class="bento-card-titanium" data-tilt>
        <div class="anisotropic-sheen"></div>

        <div class="bay-header">
          <div class="bay-metadata">
            <span class="engraved-label">DEVELOPER TOOLING</span>
            <span class="badge-metal badge-scorched-violet">Kotlin/Native</span>
            <span class="badge-metal">DevTools</span>
          </div>
          <a href="https://github.com/jesusdmedinac" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="machined-link-btn" aria-label="View CLI repositories on GitHub">
